    "long_instructions": "## Random Bonus\r\n\r\nModify the original program so it adds random bonus points to a score.\r\n\r\n1. Create a variable for a starting score.\r\n2. Create a variable for random bonus points.\r\n3. Add the starting score and bonus points together.\r\n4. Print the starting score, bonus points, and total.\r\n\r\n**Check**: Run the program several times. What changes? What stays the same?",
